Bugfix: Broken format specifiers and escape sequences in Uyghur translations

Spaces incorrectly inserted inside format specifiers (e.g. `% 1 $ s`, `% d`) have been removed, and broken escape sequences (`\ N`, `\ \"`) have been fixed.

